# A control-changing effect can decide another (CR 613.1b, 613.7): Mind Control gives its controller the creature it
# enchants, so whoever gains control of the Aura gains the creature too. Bot1's Mind Control takes Bot2's Llanowar Elves;
# at the beginning of Bot1's next combat Iroh, Tea Master has Bot2 gain control of the Mind Control, and with it Bot2
# controls the Elves again. Iroh's Ally gets a +1/+1 counter for the one permanent Bot1 owns that Bot2 controls: the Aura.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Iroh, Tea Master
Mind Control
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

